<p>This website, vlore.ca, is operated by VLORE (“we”, “us”, “our”), a web design and marketing agency based in Toronto, Ontario, Canada. These Terms &amp; Conditions apply to your use of the website. By using it, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the website.</p>
<p>Our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a> explains how we handle personal information.</p>

